SUMMARY:'A Deeper Descent' AMC Friday Ecstatic Dance w/ Guest DJ Yaku Beat
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, June 5th\nEvening Danc
 e Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nGuest
  DJ Yaku Beat w/ special guest Dustin Selva Live Flute\n\nIntention: A Dee
 per Decent\nA Deeper Decent is a dance that takes us to deep places within
  ourselves as we explore truth and find new depths within our being. The s
 et moves through the 5 rhythms with a deep sense of connectedness to Sourc
 e\, resonating between vibrational frequencies to restore our energy to it
 s purest state of presence. This dance is designed to awaken subtle curren
 ts that move through us to feel and exist more fully in our bodies.\n\nJos
 h Courtney/DJ Yaku Beat (guest)\nYaku Beat channels the spirit of water - 
 flowing\, cleansing and alive. From a life in modern medicine\, entreprene
 urship and fatherhood\, to years on the sacred plant medicine path\, Josh
 ’s evolution has spanned many worlds. Guided by an appetite for self-rev
 elation\, his beats and live instrumentation will invite you into the dept
 hs of your most wild and luminous heart.\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please not
 e that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Ci
 rcle and any that come late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensu
 re a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name y
 our price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Reco
 mmended:\n\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/.../djseigea.../](htt
 ps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/.../djseigea.../?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0
 CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAA
 R60jGoPctQmZENEP-6g1PiLerpr4LJLC5heP1Rn7TgedmIne3f6mes9kn3Wnw_aem_ASPUspeN
 ro8PjxFCFjEUGg)\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for
  free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org
 /volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZ
 Xh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODg
 yMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_ae
 m_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at 
 the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING C
 IRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcol
 lective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/
 ?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIy
 MjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDt
 tUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Col
 lective envisions a world that moves in harmony where all are free to be t
 heir authentic selves within a loving community. Our mission and aim are t
 o inspire authenticity and healthy community through free-form dance by ho
 sting dance waves for personal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(
 c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 288
 05\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amcdance/events/314542208/
