UID:8bf64b85bfbd99ff85ec60a1cff76c6f@ashevillechamber.org
DESCRIPTION:Love Your Local Land! Land trusts are non-profit organizations
  that preserve the health and heritage of our natural spaces. Also known a
 s conservancies\, land trusts may work with landowners to safeguard family
  farms\, create accessible public parks\, protect wetlands and wildlife ha
 bitats\, or provide recreational opportunities everyone can enjoy. On Land
  Trust Day\, Saturday\, June 6\, Mast General Store Asheville will donate 
 20% of the day’s sales to Southern Appalachian Highlands Conservancy. SA
 HC 
LOCATION:Asheville\, NC
