DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260606T153000
SUMMARY:Psychedelic Integration Circle
DESCRIPTION:Psychedelic Society of Asheville\nSome experiences change us b
 efore we fully understand how. Through reflection\, shared wisdom\, and ge
 nuine community\, this circle offers a safe and confidential space to make
  meaning of your experiences\, and to let that meaning actually land in yo
 ur life.\n\nWhen we integrate with intention\, we move through change with
  greater clarity\, resilience\, and compassion for ourselves and others.\n
 \nWe are delighted to welcome Becca Marshall as our circle holder. Becca i
 s an Integrative Psychotherapist\, Aligned Living Coach\, Psychedelic Inte
 gration Guide\, and founder of [ActivXchange](https://www.activxchange.com
 /) — Her work supports people navigating significant life transitions\, 
 entering adulthood\, stepping into leadership\, moving through healing and
  transformation\, with grounded presence and genuine care.\n\nThis circle 
 is open to anyone curious\, those actively preparing for or integrating an
  experience\, and those who have been walking this path for years. Our int
 ention is simple: to foster connection\, shared wisdom\, and mutual suppor
 t within our growing community here in Asheville. All are welcome.\n\nA su
 ggested donation of $10 helps cover venue costs and support future PSA off
 erings. No one will ever be turned away for lack of funds.\n\nPlease join 
 [our Discord](https://discord.gg/XXqvXXsTkB) to stay more connected with o
 ur community\, and feel free to stay tuned for more newsletter updates\, a
 s well.\n\nWe hope you're all enjoying a lovely Spring in Appalachia\, and
  we very much look forward to being in circle with you in June! 💫\n\nIn
  psychedelic service\,\nThe PSA Collective
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/psychedelic-society-of-asheville/even
 ts/314897963/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260521T210522Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260521T210522Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
