SUMMARY:Astrology & Gong Sound Alchemy
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n✨ **Star Sounds: A Sound Healing Journe
 y with David Heiss**\n**An immersive experience of Astrology & Sound Alche
 my**\nStep into an evening where **cosmic intelligence meets vibrational h
 ealing**.\nWe begin with a grounded yet intuitive transmission of the **cu
 rrent astrological landscape**—translating what’s happening in the sky
  into real guidance for navigating your life right now.\nFrom there\, you
 ’ll be guided into a **deep\, multidimensional sound journey**.\nSurroun
 ded by the resonance of **multiple gongs\, crystal and Tibetan bowls\, han
 dpan\, and other harmonic instruments**\, your body becomes the receiver
 … and the field begins to shift.\nThis is not just something you hear—
 \n**it’s something you feel\, something you enter.**\n\\#\\#\\# 🔊 **T
 he Experience**\nAs the gong waves move through you:\n\n* The nervous syst
 em begins to **downshift and unwind**\n* The mind softens\, releasing cont
 rol\n* The body opens into **deep cellular resonance**\n* Stagnant energy 
 begins to **move\, release\, and reorganize**\n\nMany describe the experie
 nce as entering a **dreamlike\, timeless state**—\nwhere insight\, emoti
 on\, and clarity arise naturally from within.\nThe sound doesn’t guide y
 ou somewhere else…\n**it brings you deeper into yourself.**\n\\#\\#\\# 
 🌌 **Why This Now**\n2026 is not a passive year—it’s a threshold.\nW
 e are being asked to **trust ourselves at a deeper level**\, to move witho
 ut certainty\, and to listen inward more than ever before.\nSound—especi
 ally the gong—has a unique ability to **bypass the thinking mind** and r
 econnect you with your own internal guidance system.\nThis journey is an o
 pportunity to:\n\n* Reset your energetic field\n* Reconnect with your intu
 ition\n* Realign with your inner rhythm\n\n\\#\\#\\# 🌀 **What is Sound 
 Healing?**\nSound healing works through **vibrational resonance**.\nThe ri
 ch\, non-linear overtones of instruments like the gong interact directly w
 ith the body’s energetic and physical systems—supporting:\n\n* Relaxat
 ion and nervous system regulation\n* Emotional release\n* Energetic cleari
 ng and activation\n* Expanded states of awareness\n\nYou don’t need to 
 “do” anything—\nsimply **lie down\, receive\, and allow**.\nReserve 
 Your Spot here: [StarSounds](https://www.starsounds.love/event-details/ast
 rology-gong-sound-alchemy)\nPrice is by Donation starting at $22. Please g
 ive what you can.\nYou can Donate w credit card here or at Vemno @Starsoun
 ds\nCash is okay at the door\, please let us know you coming...email [[Dav
 id@starsounds.love](mailto:David@starsounds.love)]([mailto:David@starsound
 s.love](http://mailto:David@starsounds.love))\n\\#\\#\\# 🧘 **What to Br
 ing**\nYoga mat • Blanket • Pillow • Water • Anything for comfort\
 n**See You There**\n\\#\\#\\# 👤 **About David Heiss**\nDavid Heiss is a
 n **Evolutionary Astrologer and Sound Alchemist** devoted to guiding other
 s into deeper self-awareness through vibration and cosmic insight.\nSince 
 2012\, he has worked with the transformative power of **gongs and astrolog
 y**\, following a profound awakening that shifted his life toward a path o
 f healing and inner discovery.\nHis work blends:\n\n* **Astrological intel
 ligence** (understanding your soul’s path)\n* **Sound immersion** (direc
 t vibrational experience)\n\nCreating a space where participants can **rem
 ember who they are on a deeper level**.\nHis intention is simple and preci
 se: to help you **experience yourself more fully**.
