SUMMARY:AMC Sunday Ecstatic Dance w/ Jeannie Adair
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, June 7th\n\n1st Dance 
 Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance Wa
 ve 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilitator
  \\| DJ Jeannie Adair\n\nntention: Exquisite\n\nSince the death of my belo
 ved 20-year-old son almost three months ago\, I have been living with exqu
 isite pain — raw\, acute\, and impossible to ignore. And within that pai
 n\, I have also felt exquisite beauty: the depth of my love for him\, the 
 love that continues beyond death\, and the extraordinary support of friend
 s\, family\, and this AMC dance community.\n\nThis mix is an invitation to
  come as you are.\nTo feel your feelings.\nTo let the body tell the truth.
  To make space for grief\, love\, gratitude\, anger\, tenderness\, numbn
 ess\, joy\, or whatever is alive in you.\nWe gather to be honest. To be hu
 man. To move what is real. Together.\n\nJeannie Adair\nJeannie is a mixed 
 media artist\, experience designer & movement medicine evangelist. She cur
 ates soulful journeys that invite emotional release & authentic connection
 . An AMC facilitator since 2023\, she’s here to hold space with intentio
 n\, care\, and a loving heart. Find her ecstatic dance mixes on Soundcloud
  at [https://soundcloud.com/dancingleontine](https://l.facebook.com/l.php?
 u=https%3A%2F%2Fsoundcloud.com%2Fdancingleontine%3Futm_id%3D97758_v0_s00_e
 223_tv4_tp1%26fbclid%3DIwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExUEw3a0M1OVdXaXZBT2RYVnNyd
 GMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR67Nc7xfTMLFRE11FU3eOccxno5-WCVffUQuJE
 YT501A946m0u4r8ttiym34Q_aem_Uh1INrKo4t7YdpJvwy8leQ&h=AT5RQSgB7tn0LAfkCFpJ9
 CvYMCpGWZhoW1-baImdpBkNOCFzAz1JIRfm2-BmiQedTqqrrLjSJi0LXhsRQFUqTwqJkWEJf6b
 c8iIR94VAJapd9_Pt4QHV-Ng8PTehm3VC803kOyOyQm-n2DVM_g&__tn__=q&c%5B0%5D=AT4Z
 LLrT3hU9xSc6IqKxXxzsS5gERlH8aZD_dynhpd-mAO2QBHaMAZC9xAWvCIeZiGjEKFQJPxPN3A
 DrBpovuJdQ2JWivnEWk3MnBz691vuEocbrJn_oToAldHiH_7GSf4lyXxg2JTtH2zYDmuO9tO3h
 RBd09dBw4jI) and her artwork.\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the da
 nce starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and peop
 le who arrive late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe
  and secure container. \\*\\*\n\nTicket Price: $15-30 or name your price.\
 nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\nPre-registration Re
 commended:\nhttps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/event/\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n
 We need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at
 : [https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemo
 vementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExUR
 ExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR6puHJaet_dJGFESCItA4r
 MD5vM_RHt9QzUSALulddRTAtGKexRuWuiBE8tDw_aem_vXP_JSWUu1NrAFuKa--PQA)\n\nIMP
 ORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening cir
 cle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective 
 agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://
 ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZB
 ExVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR5CSyB7238b
 GlkEsU_Cg_jsh0446YHLe69W1y3KV5-T6oMaN-7Z3q32wDznUA_aem_wUhim1G2JnrnWxIQYKC
 cIA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world that m
 oves in harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves within a l
 oving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and healt
 hy community through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal a
 nd community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\
 nSee you on the dance floor!
