SUMMARY:Sunday Live: Steve Lapointe
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a Sunday Live performance by Steve Lapointe\, pianist-in-residence in the Windgate Foundation Atrium. \nABOUT THE MUSICIAN\nSteve Lapointe’s nine years of classical piano as a youth grounded him in music theory. Jazz studies while in Ithaca\, New York\, opened his ears to extemporaneous improvisation and the music of Keith Jarrett\, Chick Corea\, Bill Evans\, Michel Petrucciani and the American songbook. Steve served as musical director of the Unitarian Universalist (UU) Fellowship of Vero Beach\, Florida\, and occasionally performed at the UU Asheville congregation.
