SUMMARY:AVL International Connections - June Mix and Mingle
DESCRIPTION:AVL International Connections\nFor our **June Mix & Mingle** w
 e will gather on the beautiful riverside deck @ New Belgium Brewery (River
  Arts District)! If you are new\, there will be lots of folks to welcome y
 ou!! If you haven't come for a few months\, come and meet some new folks!\
 n\nWeather permitting\, we will be outside on New Belgium’s beautiful de
 ck overlooking the river. If it is raining or chilly\, we’ll move inside
  to the taproom. Look for the Meetup signs and the AVL International Conne
 ctions' name tags. Grab a cold beverage and then join us!\n\nA local Food 
 Truck will also be out front if anyone wants a bite to eat!\n\nAs a growin
 g group (over 1500 members)\, if you have friends that you would like to b
 ring along\, please do! Also encourage them to sign up on Meetup!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/international-connections-avl/events/
 314980127/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260527T172252Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260527T172252Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
