X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Shutupandwriteasheville": "https://www.meetup.com/shutupandwriteasheville/events/314882394/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_shutupandwriteasheville
X-SOURCE:Shut Up & Write Western NC
UID:event_314882394@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260604T043528Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260609T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260609T193000
SUMMARY:Shut Up & Write!® - Downtown
DESCRIPTION:Shut Up & Write!® Western North Carolina\n***\\*\\*\\*Please 
 note: event listings are moving to the Shut Up & Write! website and this M
 eetup page will be closed in a few weeks. You will find our Tuesday night 
 events here: [https://www.shutupwrite.com/series/id2uT2JS7l00](https://www
 .shutupwrite.com/series/id2uT2JS7l00)\\*\\*\\****\n\n**Here's how it works
 .** Show up at or before 6:00. At 6:00\, we do some quick introductions. A
 fterward\, for a full 60 minutes (I'll set a timer!) we are heads-down wri
 ting. Writing what? A novel? You bet. Some poetry? Sure. Song lyrics? Your
  resume? That report you need to get to your boss before 8 AM or you'll *n
 eed* *to write* that resume? All of the above and more. Just shut up and w
 rite.\n\nSurrounding ourselves with other writers who are busy putting wor
 ds onto page (physical or virtual) keeps us all accountable and focused.\n
 \nWhen the timer goes off\, we'll check-in with each other and see how it 
 went. Afterward\, feel free to stay to chat and get to know your fellow wr
 iters\, or keep writing\, or take off.\n\nSocializing is optional and will
  happen after (or briefly before) the focused writing. This is a safe spac
 e to work on your craft. No one will read or critique your writing.\n\nFor
  more information about our events\, visit [https://shutupwrite.com](https
 ://shutupwrite.com).\n\n**What to Expect**\n\n* Roughly 15 minutes of intr
 oductions\n* 60 minutes of focused writing (somebody set a timer)!\n* Afte
 rward\, optional socializing\n\n**Being late is okay:** Just show up and g
 et settled\, then check in with the host after the session. (Look for the 
 person with the Shut Up & Write sign).\n\n**What Should I Bring?**\n\n* Wh
 atever you need to be able to write!\n* Earbuds/earplugs if you want to bl
 ock ambient noise.\n\n**Other Important Details:**\n\n***\\*\\*\\*Please n
 ote: event listings are moving to the Shut Up & Write! website and this Me
 etup page will be closed in a few weeks. You will find our Tuesday night e
 vents here: [https://www.shutupwrite.com/series/id2uT2JS7l00](https://www.
 shutupwrite.com/series/id2uT2JS7l00)\\*\\*\\****\n\nHOSTS: This is a multi
 -host event\, so most of the time there will be a host present. If we are 
 unlucky and no host can attend\, please find each other and self-organize.
  Pay attention to the event chat and comments to see who is available.\n\n
 WI-FI: Yes!\n\nPARKING: Street parking in metered spots is free after 6pm.
  Closest municipal garages ($2/hour) are Wall St. & Coxe Street/Sears Alle
 y.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/shutupandwriteasheville/events/314882
 394/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260520T221743Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260520T221743Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
