CREATED:20260513T160316Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260527T141414Z
UID:10006614-1781193600-1781204400@www.ashevilleart.org
SUMMARY:The Art of Paper: Member Reception
DESCRIPTION:As a valued Museum Member\, we invite you to join us for the exclusive reception of our newest exhibition\, The Art of Paper: Selections of Handmade Paper Works from the Collections of Jordan D. Schnitzer and His Family Foundation \n4–5pm | Upper-Level Members \nRegister Here \n5–7pm | All Members \nRegister Here \nAbout the Exhibition\nThe Art of Paper: Selections of Handmade Paper Works from the Collections of Jordan D. Schnitzer and His Family Foundation | Curated by Brett Littman with Susan Gosin and Cynthia Nourse Thompson\, the exhibition features 66 works by leading artists of the 20th and 21st centuries\, including Helen Frankenthaler\, James Rosenquist\, Frank Stella\, Jasper Johns\, Mark Bradford\, Glenn Ligon and others who have redefined handmade paper as an expressive artistic medium. The thoughtful selection of works chronicles the pioneering achievements within the discipline and reveals how the field of handmade paper art was a natural advancement of and response to the historic relationship between print and paper. Drawn exclusively from the renowned collections of Jordan D. Schnitzer and His Family Foundation\, the exhibition highlights the inventive intersections of papermaking\, printmaking and collaborative artistic practice.  \nPlease note:\nExhibition Previews are reserved for current Museum Members; please only register Members included in your membership. \nJoin the fun—Become a Member today!
URL:https://www.ashevilleart.org/event/theartofpaper/
LOCATION:Asheville Art Museum\, 2 South Pack Square\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Members-Only Preview
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.ashevilleart.org/wp-content/uploads/Art-of-Paper-Header-1.png
GEO:35.5946714;-82.5512827
