DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260611T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260611T203000
SUMMARY:Classy Cocktails @ District 42
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n🍸✨ Classy Cocktails at District 42 
 ✨🍸\n\nDate: Thursday\, June 11th\nTime: 6:30 PM – 8:30 PM\nLocation
 : District 42 Cocktail Lounge\n7 Patton Avenue\, Asheville\, NC\n\nWhat th
 is event is all about\n\nThis month we're stepping things up a notch. 😎
 \n\nClassy Cocktails is heading to District 42\, one of downtown Asheville
 's most elegant cocktail lounges\, tucked inside the beautiful Hotel Arras
 . If you've been looking for an excuse to dust off your favorite date-nigh
 t outfit\, stylish blazer\, fancy shoes\, or that shirt you've been saving
  for "someday\," this might just be it. 🍸✨\n\nBut this venue isn't ju
 st beautiful. It's steeped in Asheville history.\n\nThe name District 42 p
 ays tribute to the original 42 lots that once occupied the corner of Broad
 way and Biltmore Avenue. The building itself has been part of Asheville's 
 skyline for decades\, evolving from the iconic Northwestern Bank Building 
 to the BB&T Building and eventually becoming the stunning Hotel Arras we k
 now today.\n\nIn other words\, you'll be sipping craft cocktails in a plac
 e that has watched Asheville reinvent itself for generations. Not a bad ba
 ckdrop for an evening of great conversation and questionable life decision
 s. 😏\n\nWhat You're In For\n\n🍸 Handcrafted cocktails and elevated l
 ounge vibes\n\n🏙️ A stylish downtown setting filled with Asheville hi
 story\n\n😄 Interesting conversations with fellow digital nomads\, entre
 preneurs\, remote workers\, creatives\, and adventurers\n\n✨ A chance to
  dress up just a little and enjoy a more sophisticated evening out\n\n🍹
  Small plates available if hunger decides to join the party\n\n📸 Plenty
  of opportunities to pretend you're far more important and glamorous than 
 you actually are\n\nWho Should Come?\n\nYou should come if you enjoy good 
 people\, good drinks\, good conversation\, and occasionally leaving your h
 ouse.\n\nYou do not need a business card.\n\nYou do not need an elevator p
 itch.\n\nYou do not need a five-year plan.\n\nYou simply need to show up\,
  grab a cocktail\, and enjoy an evening with fun humans. 🥂\n\nA Few Fri
 endly Notes\n\nThis is a purely social event. While you may make new frien
 ds\, find collaborators\, discover opportunities\, or accidentally meet yo
 ur future spouse\, business partner\, or dog sitter\, none of that is requ
 ired. 😉\n\nCome for a few minutes or stay the whole evening.\n\nBring a
  friend or come solo.\n\nEither way\, pull up a chair\, order something de
 licious\, and join us for a classy night out in one of Asheville's most ic
 onic historic buildings.\n\nSee you at District 42! 🍸✨🥂🏙️😎
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/315044130/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260531T211553Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260531T211553Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
