SUMMARY:'A Multitude of Drops' AMC Friday Ecstatic Dance w/ DJ Esmæ
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, June 12th\n\nEvening D
 ance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nFa
 cilitator Pathway DJ Esmæ\n\nIntention: A Multitude of Drops\n\nInspired 
 by my favorite quote from the book Cloud Atlas - “My life amounts to no 
 more than one drop in a limitless ocean. Yet what is an ocean but a multit
 ude of drops?” - David Mitchell\n\nAbout the DJ (Facilitator Pathway)\nD
 J Esmæ (Megan Belling) has been moving in the world of ecstatic dance for
  over 13 years and sharing musical journeys as a DJ for the past 5. Her se
 ts weave sound into pathways of remembrance\, honoring the unfolding of on
 e’s own becoming. She invites an awakening of expression and emotion tha
 t may have been resting beneath the surface. Through tension\, rhythm\, an
 d texture\, she holds space for dancers to return to themselves.\nListen t
 o her mixes at: [https://soundcloud.com/djesmae](https://soundcloud.com/dj
 esmae?utm_id=97758_v0_s00_e223_tv4_tp1&fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExUE
 w3a0M1OVdXaXZBT2RYVnNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4ggbnEohOZ94TU
 nWPAicVHteJYL-Vbl-dWeYQnw59RnToTclK5Q1ESMI_QPQ_aem_4hciEUoMe8CEWfa0kdm6iQ)
 \n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The 
 doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turn
 ed away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\n
 Ticket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lac
 k of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\n[https://ashevillemovementco
 llective.org/.../djseigea.../](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/...
 /djseigea.../?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGM
 GYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR60jGoPctQmZENEP-6g1PiLerpr4LJLC5heP1Rn7
 TgedmIne3f6mes9kn3Wnw_aem_ASPUspeNro8PjxFCFjEUGg)\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need v
 olunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https
 ://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementco
 llective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10Y
 UN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcb
 Nb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\nIMPORTANT ANN
 OUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening circle. Ple
 ase note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreemen
 ts:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevill
 emovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0
 ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf
 8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\n
 About AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in 
 harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves within a loving co
 mmunity. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy commu
 nity through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and commu
 nity transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocatio
 n: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
