SUMMARY:Shut Up & Write!® in Candler/West Asheville
DESCRIPTION:Shut Up & Write!® Western North Carolina\nPlease join me and 
 other local writers for a group writing session. Bring whatever you're wor
 king on and grab a coffee\, and we will write alongside each other.\n\nThi
 s is not a critique group\, but we do have short social periods before and
  after writing.\n\\-\\-\\-\nMany have mentioned that The Dripolator is a l
 ittle hard to find if you've never been before. The coffeeshop is located 
 in a strip mall where the Candler YMCA is\, and the sonic. The Dripolator 
 is next to the bank\, and looks a little like a house. There is usually pl
 enty of parking in the lot out front. If you're having trouble send me a m
 essage!
