DESCRIPTION:Asheville Lose The Booze Crew (20-40s)\nHi friends!! Let’s t
 ry some music bingo this month. Make sure your phone is fully charged as t
 he bingo cards are digital.\n\nPlease note that we are meeting at a brewer
 y\, and as with every event we host\, we ask that you remain booze free wh
 ile attending. **Hi-wire has a selection of NA beverages you can enjoy!**\
 n\n**We will meet at 5:45 pm** to mingle\, grab bevvies\, and get comfy to
