SUMMARY:Come sing with us! Vocal workshop and rehearsal - Land Of The Sky 
 Chorus
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Area A Cappella Singers\nWhether you are an experien
 ced singer\, or just like to sing in your car\, come join us as our guest!
  The Land of The Sky Chorus\, located in Asheville\, NC\, is welcoming gue
 sts - men and women - who are interested in joining us in the world-wide c
 ommunity of a cappella singing.\n\nNo experience is required\; we provide 
 music\, voice training and an enjoyable singing experience under expert le
 adership. Our repertoire of music is fun and spans many styles - most song
 s are easy to learn and sing. Learning materials are provided to help you 
 get started\, and you will be paired with a singing "Buddy" so you can joi
 n in right away.\n\nWe will be here to greet you as early as 6:15pm to hel
 p you get situated.
