SUMMARY:✨ She Owns It AVL ✨
DESCRIPTION:✨She Owns It AVL✨\n✨ **She Owns It Meetup** ✨\n\n**Jun
 e Featured Guest:** **Dr. Britta Memmesheimer**\, of South Slope Acupunctu
 re & Wellness — founder of the TEAM Fertility Method and a Doctor of Acu
 puncture and Chinese Medicine who helps women navigate stress\, burnout\, 
 hormonal health\, chronic pain\, fertility\, and overall wellness through 
 a compassionate and holistic approach to healing.\n\n**Dr. Britta will sha
 re her story** — what led her to this work\, the experiences that shaped
  her path\, and what she’s learned about slowing down\, listening to you
 r body\, and supporting women in a world that often asks them to carry too
  much. Through her work\, she helps women feel more connected to themselve
 s\, supported in their healing\, and empowered in their wellness journeys.
 \n\n✨ Each month\, **She Owns It AVL** gathers women ready to grow\, con
 nect\, and belong. We focus on life\, money\, mindset\, and wellness — c
 reating space for real conversations\, meaningful relationships\, and last
 ing connection and inspiration.\n\n**We can’t wait to see you there!** 
 💫\nCome early to connect! 5:30\n\nWe’re so grateful for everyone who 
 signs up to join us! If your plans shift\, please update your RSVP—it he
 lps us plan the evening and make space for other women who’d love to att
 end
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/she-owns-it-avl/events/314965803/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260526T192148Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260526T192148Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
