SUMMARY:'Embrace Joy' AMC Friday Ecstatic Dance w/ Marta Martin
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, June 19th\n\nEvening D
 ance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nFa
 cilitator \\| DJ Marta Martin\n\nIntention: Embrace Joy\nAs we draw near t
 he vast embrace of Summer\,\n\nmay we uncover the light that quietly bloom
 s within us\,\nand let it spill outward—\na radiant offering of joy\, wo
 nder\,\nand gratitude for the simple miracle of being alive.\n\nAbout Mart
 a Martin\n\nMarta (she/her/ella) has been part of AMC since she moved to A
 sheville from Surfside\, FL in 2008. She has been teaching movement for ov
 er 30 years\, using music and movements from around the world. She loves t
 o motivate people to find freedom in their bodies so they can dance to the
  spirit. Listen to her mixes on Mixcloud ([https://www.mixcloud.com/Dancin
 gMarta/](https://www.mixcloud.com/DancingMarta/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAY
 nJpZBExUEw3a0M1OVdXaXZBT2RYVnNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR62ri5
 Nrm8XWJLkmMMH3ledewNFoN8SdmekhAKysKK2fKvFGblgAhrOvfiGsQ_aem_tWcDHVFAH7DhKK
 PGxObWww) ) and Soundcloud ([https://soundcloud.com/dancingmarta](https://
 soundcloud.com/dancingmarta?utm_id=97758_v0_s00_e223_tv4_tp1&fbclid=IwZXh0
 bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExUEw3a0M1OVdXaXZBT2RYVnNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMD
 A4OTIAAR4ggbnEohOZ94TUnWPAicVHteJYL-Vbl-dWeYQnw59RnToTclK5Q1ESMI_QPQ_aem_4
 hciEUoMe8CEWfa0kdm6iQ) )\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance
  starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any tha
 t come late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and se
 cure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo
  one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\n[htt
 ps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/.../djseigea.../](https://ashevillemo
 vementcollective.org/.../djseigea.../?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZ
 WQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR60jGoPctQmZENEP
 -6g1PiLerpr4LJLC5heP1Rn7TgedmIne3f6mes9kn3Wnw_aem_ASPUspeNro8PjxFCFjEUGg)\
 nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register 
 to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](htt
 ps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAY
 nJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdF
 INP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1poot
 RUE4YAfA)\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginning of
  the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES
 !\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-
 dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bg
 NhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4
 OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrj
 KIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envision
 s a world that moves in harmony where all are free to be their authentic s
 elves within a loving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authen
 ticity and healthy community through free-form dance by hosting dance wave
 s for personal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit 
 organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on
  the dance floor!
