UID:be13419e9f51f93d0579eefe8253b66f@ashevillechamber.org
DESCRIPTION:The mission of Letters From Home is to honor veterans\, celebr
 ate people\, and unite the nation through music. Letters From Home infuses
  the classic style of war-time music with a witty\, modern edge. Featuring
  high-energy singing and tap dancing performances by founder Erinn Dearth 
 and self-proclaimed “tall guy” Dan Beckmann. Funny and heartfelt\, har
 monic and uplifting\, Letters From Home will leave you feeling great about
  being human.
