  invites you to stretch\, laugh\, and unwind alongside the sweetest\, snug
 gliest little socialites. Expect giggles\, goat cuddles\, and a beginner-f
 riendly flow that’s easy to follow (and easy to jump back into when you 
 get distracted). Set on a cozy wholesome family micro- farm\, it’s the p
 erfect way to disconnect from stress and reconnect with your sense of play
 . What to
