SUMMARY:AMC Sunday Ecstatic Dance w/ Robert Kochka
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, June 21st\n\n1st Dance
  Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance W
 ave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilitato
 r \\| DJ Robert Kochka\\\, Support Amanda Crowe\n\nIntention: TBA\n\nAbout
  the DJ & Support Robert Kochka & Amanda Crowe\nRobert Kochka’s amazing 
 dance waves and DJ sets are known for their fullness: bass\, feeling\, and
  energy! You’ll dance\, you’ll move\, you’ll feel new vibrations! Li
 sten to his sets here: [https://soundcloud.com/robert-kochka-jr](https://s
 oundcloud.com/robert-kochka-jr?utm_id=97758_v0_s00_e223_tv4_tp1&fbclid=IwZ
 Xh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExUEw3a0M1OVdXaXZBT2RYVnNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODg
 yMDA4OTIAAR459rrq1c8O2OoYnMTXHdnM7OYfGIjW2AUBxFPQYfri_jFoCISpO_E_IZ6oJw_ae
 m_n_KEZzn9q9BiH0emdmSyHg)\nAmanda Crowe sets and holds a wonderful contain
 er seeded with intention and beauty. This pair will lay out the carpet to 
 welcome you more deeply into yourself\, and perhaps into togetherness on t
 he dance floor.\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts a
 t Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and people who arriv
 e late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure 
 container. \\*\\*\n\nTicket Price: $15-30 or name your price.\nNo one turn
 ed away for lack of funds!\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\nPre-registration Recommended:\n
 https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/event/\n\nVOLUNTEER!\nWe need volu
 nteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at: [https://a
 shevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollec
 tive.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFU
 HNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR6puHJaet_dJGFESCItA4rMD5vM_RHt9Qz
 USALulddRTAtGKexRuWuiBE8tDw_aem_vXP_JSWUu1NrAFuKa--PQA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOU
 NCEMENTS:\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please 
 note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\
 n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemov
 ementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURE
 xqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR5CSyB7238bGlkEsU_Cg_js
 h0446YHLe69W1y3KV5-T6oMaN-7Z3q32wDznUA_aem_wUhim1G2JnrnWxIQYKCcIA)\n\nAbou
 t AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in harm
 ony where all are free to be their authentic selves within a loving commun
 ity. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy community
  through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and community
  transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nSee you on 
 the dance floor!
