SUMMARY:AMC Sunday Ecstatic Dance w/ DJ Mikaya
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, June 28th\n\n1st Dance
  Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance W
 ave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nDJ Mikaya\
 n\nIntention: TBA\n\nAbout the DJ\nDJ Mikaya (Micah Swabb) is a facilitato
 r at AMC and creator of dance waves with many styles and flavors within th
 e Ecstatic Dance realm. His deejay skill has spanned over two decades cove
 ring many ecstatic dance containers\, festivals\, sound healing events and
  yoga classes. You can listen to his catalog of over 80 mixes and mashups 
 at [http://soundcloud.com/mikayaswabb](https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=http
 s%3A%2F%2Fsoundcloud.com%2Fmikayaswabb%3Futm_id%3D97758_v0_s00_e223_tv4_tp
