DESCRIPTION:Location: Enka-Candler Library - 1404 Sandhill Rd. - Candler
 <br>Phone: (828) 250-4758<br>Email: enka.library@buncombecounty.org<br>E
 vent Type: Family Fun\,STEM/STEAM\,Story Telling<br>Age Group: Toddler -
  (ages 18 mos.-2 yrs.)\,Preschool - (ages 3-5)\,School Age - (grades K-5
 )\,Family - (children of all ages)<br>Library: Enka-Candler<br>Link: htt
 ps://www.buncombecounty.org/governing/depts/library/branch-locations/enk
 a-candler.aspx<br><br>Meet Gracie\, a certified therapy dog whose spirit
  and affectionate personality are sure to win your heart. Despite having
  one less leg\, this ten year old &quot\;tripod&quot\; Great Pyrenees mi
 x is excited about life\, always eager for a run or swim and approaches 
 everything with a big smile. Gracie&#39\;s physical difference does not 
 stop her mission to spread love and happiness to everyone she meets. Her
  empathy and willingness to listen\, make her the perfect friend for any
 one in need of comfort or support.<br><br>Join Gracie and her parent\, L
 isa\, for an hour at the library where you can take turns reading\, pett
 ing\, or saying hello! No registration is required for this program\, bu
 t we will ask you to sign-in so everyone gets to spend time with Gracie.
  Gracie is child friendly &amp\; parents must stay with children.&#160\;
 <br><br><em>**Our allergy free\, robot dog\, Puptart will still be avail
 able on Wednesdays from 4-5 PM!</em>
