 ocations/enka-candler.aspx<br><br>Puptart is a tail wagging robot dog wh
 o sits and stays\, pants when listening\, and responds to someone talkin
 g to and petting it. It will not jump up or run away\, plus it&#39\;s fu
 r free\, so no sneezes and runny noses coming your way!<br><br>Every Wed
 nesday afternoon\, Puptart will be available for reading practice in the
  children&#39\;s picture book room. Help establish a joy of reading and 
