SUMMARY:AVL H3 Run #??? - Trail by Sicilian and Kotex
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Hash House Harriers (AVLH3)\n**WHERE:** Same as it e
 ver was\n**WHEN:** Date\, Standard start is 2pm gather\, 2:30pm Hares away
 \n**HARES:** Sicilian and Kotex\n**HASH CASH:** ***$8.*** (**$5** non-alco
 hol options) for beer (or similar) only.\n**SHIGGY LEVEL:** Expected terra
 in (e.g.\, pavement\, running trail\, woods\, wetlands\, etc.). 1-10 'diff
 iculty rating' helps.\n**DETAILS / VIBE:** Anything you want the pack to k
 now (e.g.\, dog-friendly\, short/long\, ID needed\, etc.)\n**ON-ON! (your 
 salutation) PLEASE ADVERTISE YOUR TRAIL!**\n\\*\\*All events are intended 
 for those 21 years old and up unless otherwise specified\\*\\*
